{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K99IZG3pYwsUQPy7c8zdXQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:58.025642+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K99IZG3pYwsUQPy7c8zdXQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaJIU6eyA5ppwPGSDiahT7fxhiaXnKZwOVTgMzAVw31HUrtMGk0leGgeWHAU9PGYy3DZsdHG12dBkFrxF8Wq0iaBNGuT40WibicMz5Qw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaLRcPX8uIIOqa9ZyicjvG48ymVia2zeqwNwds01rlcERPewEpCibfkEm2TxepojWslJqtpDQyZEOUKEE7YXnYZuqCKbRGNZE9w8ico/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为拓展优秀研究生生源，同时为全国优秀大学生提供学习交流、报考咨询的平台，北京协和医学院放射医学研究所将于7月中旬在天津举办2026年“全国优秀大学生夏令营活动”。欢迎各位优秀大学生踊跃报名参加，深入了解我单位的学科专业特色、研究方向及导师团队。期待与心怀理想的你，在美丽的津城相逢！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>北京协和医学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>中国医学科学院成立于1956年，北京协和医学院建校于1917年。中国医学科学院-北京协和医学院自1957年起实行院校合一的管理体制（以下简称“院校”），是我国最高医学研究机构和最高医学教育机构。院校始终牢记初心使命，以我国医学科技教育发展和维护人民健康为己任，教育人才辈出，科研硕果累累，医疗领衔行业，为我国现代科学医学体系的建立和发展做出了重要贡献。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NYdwnhrqibaK15U31fmnSsLAPgqIyYqdd7RtiaV4bSF3YCM5WuCxlCyBFABn1mJYCHW2AriaKIQ4Y9JOnLR3HZCumIw6iawj2MeUKmUG6pZH6UQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>放射医学研究所简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>中国医学科学院放射医学研究所于1959年成立，是中国医学科学院北京协和医学院的直属研究所，是我国卫生系统中最早从事放射医学与核医学研究的专业机构，是我国放射医学、辐射防护与损伤救治、实验核医学创新研究国家级科研机构。研究所现在有博士生导师21人，硕士生导师29人，国家级领军人才、青年人才8名，天津市杰青6名，天津市授衔专家、有突出贡献专家8名，天津131创新型人才29名，国家核事故应急救援专家组成员4名。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaKkFV4a1s78ibaJia0ib2r676Q9iaY0nhnfpce4TdcianJGHmxqTbOAu3CKttLgqdnIZD5wrdYEclAMLGNyzC0UGwiclZSic7zCYah2Vw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>放射所是我国放射医学及实验核医学人才的培养基地，已培养500余名博士和硕士研究生。面向国家重大需求和人民生命健康，专注于放射医学、核医学、环境医学关键科学问题和新兴前沿领域，以基础理论突破、关键技术攻关、实用成果转化为导向开展研究工作，形成了特色鲜明的学科体系和开拓创新的人才队伍。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NYdwnhrqibaLYM2L6sF6RQ8ZfmfMMibrADr2sI4TdTyoaTxWOGOA04BaPLflbVFf2U1Fco2WxKNAdiaXvualBrGkRXwwNV2FeQPFVOspk2Opr4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>放射所承担了国家科技攻关和天津市重大科技项目，取得了丰硕的科研成果。获得了科技成果奖百余项。现有刘鉴峰、刘强、樊赛军、赵瑜、刘伦涛、崔明、黄帆、柳杨、徐文清、杨翠红、徐洪兵、彭鑫、崔希洋、潘雨辰、任春华等15个课题组。</span></p><p><span>在新的科研征程上，放射所勇于承担国家重大科研项目，为核事业的持续蓬勃发展和保驾护航做出新的贡献。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NYdwnhrqibaJIjgzKOOZ2K9os6jdJjVSO68DE11I4yb1RdiaibbtUTiaPpq58FS4POOWoLWcVgLEq9KhMLEUTXFwqBoazTExkzkgibzLvyXedLB4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaLeDv6PV2TSTctXkLTPqTLwRzWWZNabNbaSfDYJia3FwsXICFPdl9bNNPiaUHdrN8icJqRbOz6jibQLO4GL3Sfzq15lsmjfRhutrQo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong><strong><span>代码</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>招生</span></strong><strong><span>专业</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>类别</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100106</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>放射医学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>077806</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>放射医学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100401</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>流行病与卫生统计学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100402</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>劳动卫生与环境卫生学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>083100</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>生物医学工程</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>107200</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>生物医学工程</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>071</span><span><span>0</span></span><span>10</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>生物化学与分子生物学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100701</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>药物化学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100702</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>药剂学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100704</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>药物分析学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>100706</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>药理学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>105300</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>公共卫生</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>105500</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>药学</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaK8eaibLc8YnTeZKBzSHN0230YiaE1dFXQNspaOIayBzCZwWEqicnH59Fysl74bPTjWwHkUzPEI0hVa4WvaBQRxfKTb0RauMrAgaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>导师介绍</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaLWA3Zmia6TyrIojrfQ6VvYENS846rqYYQp25LVcdia17iaaujk0RQ86Eul19xb9sLJxN305MAeGS2Spn442f9VRQbqibyoXBvDdKM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>扫描二维码查看</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaLDOBMgdmgBUqEcX63gRjqicBlhiaU5tyS60ry0Aiau4BOt7A78eFib3FGsH6qaVicJMh7v0Js2FV7TaJWIG0S4jeGu3yd7LyMuHJQo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营活动详情</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>北京协和医学院放射医学研究所2026年“全国优秀大学生夏令营活动”初定于2026年7月中旬举办。在本次夏令营活动中您将走进实验室，了解各专业发展历程，聆听专题报告，参与学术交流和科研工作。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>招收对象</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>拟招收招生相关专业在校本科生30-40名。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>①拥护中国共产党的领导，具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，热爱祖国，身心健康，遵守法律、法规和学校的规章制度，诚实守信、品行端正；</span></p><p><span>②生物医学、生命科学、药学、生物医学工程、医学等相关专业大三、大四在校本科生（2027年6月本科毕业的在校学生）；</span></p><p><span>③学习成绩优异，对科学研究工作有浓厚的兴趣，立志将来投身科学研究。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请扫描二维码进行网上报名</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NYdwnhrqibaILcNXTECC9mUNoswIKZhdCZGZCpAvAZ5e8VpibvYWnKVVOV3LyicwH1L0LzTSoDpah32uiatntUtdlNb5kZBpTzjLwQPcPDbzbicM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>报名后提交附照片的个人简历一份，成绩单及佐证材料一份，所有材料合成一个PDF文件，文件命名：姓名+学校，发送至邮箱fengziou@irm-cams.ac.cn。</span></p><p><span>收到个人简历及成绩单以后将统一筛查，待通过筛查后公布入营名单。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>时间安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>① 报名截止时间为6月15日17:00，请在此之前填写并提交报名表及相关材料；</span></p><p><span>② 材料初审时间为6月16日至6月26日，以收到报名信息及材料为准。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>招生咨询方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>联系人：冯老师  赵老师</span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：022-85683048</span></p><p><span>扫二维码进招生宣传群</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpoli